{"seq":3,"slug":"influential-writings","title":"Influential Writings","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/influential-writings","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"innovation-and-entrepreneurship-book","title":"《创新与企业家精神》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/influential-writings/innovation-and-entrepreneurship-book","wordCount":1598,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"later-writings","title":"晚期著作与社会思想","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/major-works/influential-writings/later-writings","wordCount":1670,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章考察德鲁克影响深远的其他著作。《创新与企业家精神》（1985年），第一次系统地将&quot;创新&quot;建构为一门可以组织、管理、学习的实践，是关于创新与创业的奠基性经典。此外，德鲁克一生还写下了大量超越管理的社会思想著作（如《经济人的末日》《后资本主义社会》），尤其晚年对&quot;知识社会&quot;&quot;非营利组织&quot;的深刻思考，充分展现了他作为&quot;社会生态学家&quot;的博大与深刻。本章揭示德鲁克思想之博大。</p>\n"}